bluejetty:00079181:ios.description:
You have the opportunity to be the driver of the legendary Military trucks such as: Kamaz, Kraz, Gaz, Zil and others.
You will have the opportunity to buy and upgrade purchased trucks and transport a variety of goods in this way.
In addition, you will find a completely open world with a variety of locations. You will be able to transport loads on the road and off-road.
Feel like a real Military truck driver!
Features:
- a variety of Military Soviet-made trucks;
- a variety of loads and locations;
- completely open world;
- the ability to pump trucks.

